# Colours in Luv space: luv_colours

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:giggly, path: Path.join(__DIR__, "..")},
  {:kino, "~> 0.19"}
  ])
```

## About this notebook

ggplot2's reference page for
[`luv_colours`](https://ggplot2.tidyverse.org/reference/luv_colours.html) has no examples, so this
notebook says only what the page describes and where Giggly stands.

`luv_colours` holds every one of R's built-in `colors()`, 657 of them, translated into the Luv
colour space: each colour's name and its position in that space, `L`, `u` and `v`. Not in Giggly
yet: the `luv_colours` dataset.